## Fonts

The fonts included in the `fonts/` directory (Times New Roman font family) are 
**proprietary fonts owned by Microsoft Corporation** and are NOT covered by the 
MIT License above.

These fonts are included in this repository for **educational purposes only** to 
demonstrate the template functionality. Users are responsible for ensuring they 
have proper licensing rights to use these fonts. The fonts may be subject to 
Microsoft's End User License Agreement (EULA).

If you plan to use this template:
- Ensure you have a valid license to use the Times New Roman fonts (typically 
  included with Windows or Microsoft Office)
- Remove the fonts from the `fonts/` directory if you do not have proper licensing
- Replace them with appropriately licensed alternatives if needed

**The maintainers of this repository make no claims of ownership or licensing 
rights to the Microsoft fonts and include them solely for educational demonstration 
purposes.**

